NodeEditInput.description:
Body for PATCH /nodes/{job_id}/{node_key}. All edit fields optional;
only provided ones change. expected_version drives the optimistic lock
(omit for last-write-wins).

post.description:
Execute all DAG nodes in sequence, streaming SSE events.
Auto-generates DAG if none exists.  Failed nodes are skipped;
downstream nodes blocked by failures are reported at the end.
